Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,STAND UP TALL,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach out your hand, cast through\Nthe wind and make a stand, the paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,WITHIN BRINGS OUT A MAP OF YOUR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,OWN To the left
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and the right all we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,saw stormy nights All the rough\Nwinds and waves coming day after day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way, the best that we\Nknow. With tears and doubts in tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll go where we all wanna go The\Npage within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a flaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, uh, that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My body will not heed my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must consider how large I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Merely lifting my head\Nwill put me so high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all grown up and you're\Nstill scared of heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Warriors such as I fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop whining and\Nstart flying. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bother getting big if\Nyou're still going to be a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fly already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop pushing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to argue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been gone long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido could be killing\Nour friends right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But my heart is unprepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the eyelids! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking down Kaido and\Nwe're doing it together, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,clever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,defense I have a job to do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we'll defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to survive till he comes back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallowed Glacier Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you putting on a show, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You fooled yourself into\Nthinking you're a part of one,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're challenging\Nme as if you're its hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, you're an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be my child, and\Nyou'll always have my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else is just a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Set your belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to take on something\Nthat can never belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But the samurai don't see you as an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't bring their\Napproval for who I even tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know a damn thing about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lived your whole\Nmiserable life on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've spent it all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,scuttering about in the ceilings like a\Ncockroach without a friend to your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you think i don't have friends well you're\Nwrong i made a friend who gave me hope
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead and lost Just like those\Nsamurai you grew close to years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny how everyone who's ever\Nbeen kind to you ends up dead
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's so cold, it's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm starving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're there, ogre princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:07:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him before someone notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did the commander\Nexecute him all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was delivering food to the\Nogre princess and he got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He even brought her a blanket\Nbecause the weather's been so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So the princess is still on the run, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying she wants to be Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed them yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to educate my\Nchild, and they got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what they deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't learned your lesson now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What will I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only thing you have in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think those people from the\Nland of Wano are your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but they don't give a damn about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a convenience to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll come to fear you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must rule people by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're an ogre's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans will never come to\Naccept someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray, you've got this, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my intent!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Forward! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon's trails are fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can keep this,\Nwe'll be there in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting off course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, move to the left! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And left is this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,YAH! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see anyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw someone fighting way up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try to aim for the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The roof? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take you there post haste! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're way too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Down I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're turning the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you flying with your\Neyes closed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be terrified if I could see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flying the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Gyno's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so low-y!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you big?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just open your eyes, Robo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got some debris stuck in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for\Ncrashing into everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, Luffy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some guts and look ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their castle, third floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander kind of was\Nrunning wild in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not the commander.\NIt can't be. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying there's\Na second giant dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be. It's pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase it down and find\Nout who it is. Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is noisy down there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lin-Lin, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make that hag pay for all the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,repairs I can't rest yet my job's not done
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine swiftness. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is. We made it, did we? Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up terribly high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find some place to land quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there, on top of the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim straight for Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Define!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,White Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack Calgary!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uuuuhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uuuuhhhhhhh!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yama, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been holding back Kaido\Nthis whole time I was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've met, unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have work left to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die till I become\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be the one who\Nsaves Straw Hat from death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the man who will become\Nthe Land of Wano Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoying yourself, Otaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is far too dangerous\Nfor a young girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master, but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go and help everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do everything within\Nour power to keep Tama safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Osama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let her be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just sighted a mysterious dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently on the rooftop,\Nalongside young master Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's Yamato who was\Nholding off the commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The two dragons are faking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy was hiding their cook cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A pink dragon and an azure\Ndragon staring each other down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's someone on the dragon's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink dragon's identity is a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no doubt it is a deadly enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I look closer,\Nyou're a dragon, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my father, I wish I\Ncould turn into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,like he does at least i'd\Nbe of some use to my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,what a surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you grew
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Up fast, brat. Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, this world isn't\Nbig. Pick it up for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,giant dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to breathe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you breathe something, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, breathe something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it like Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You act like it's normal\Nfor people to breathe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No stop I'm not here to\Nfight I'm peaceful Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to bite Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to show him what we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-dum elephant guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.34,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to bite Kaidou!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make certain both of you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:23:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.40,0:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.56,0:24:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.\NNow tell me your name, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.82,0:25:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.58,0:25:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.16,0:25:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to\Nthe land of Wano and its people!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.84,0:25:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother would be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stay out of this,\Nyou pathetic little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.42,0:26:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just call him Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That pink dragon is Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.16,0:26:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our shogun is doing Wano proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.10,0:26:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know you have\Nthe power to hurt Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons bring thunderclouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.26,0:26:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And now there are two dragons here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious moon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.14,0:26:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And not a moment too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:27:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had taken even one more attack, I\Nwould be kneeling in defeat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But the power your Su-Long transformation\Ngrants you is a double-edged sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's left you with no\Nmore strength to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, his power went away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall come to your reign at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.26,0:27:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to wait your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.46,0:27:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon didn't betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got lickety-lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:28:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a good run, but now it's\Nlickety-likes out for you, boss cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.40,0:28:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.96,0:28:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who you just took a bite out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,An emperor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything left in the\Nworld that can scare you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.76,0:28:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.88,0:28:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.18,0:28:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With your eyes open this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to stop Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.32,0:29:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.96,0:29:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.94,0:29:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Woofie's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.52,0:29:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him the O of war, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.00,0:30:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is gonna be super!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.16,0:30:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.82,0:30:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.72,0:30:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real riot, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure likes to talk big. What's\Nhe been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Always keeps his word,\Nthat's our Loopy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.96,0:30:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's finally time
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.92,0:31:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you have even a\Nsingle chance of defeating me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have infinite chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.56,0:32:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like in the journal,\NOdin wrote about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,when Roger and Whitebeard clashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He said the heavens split open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.86,0:32:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.74,0:32:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds have split.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough from you, Gaara.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck sees me back on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.84,0:33:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yagor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.64,0:33:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.60,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're having a ball\Nup there, aren't you, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.22,0:33:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let our friends\Nshow us up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.32,0:33:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden, One Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.88,0:33:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Frenzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save it, not!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.66,0:34:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll tear you apart, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Canine Cleaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.20,0:34:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.06,0:35:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could share one last drink with\Nyou, Gaara, under this beautiful moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.74,0:35:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.54,0:35:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.72,0:35:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.54,0:35:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a fine performance, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.74,0:35:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.02,0:35:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugarra did what none of us could.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.14,0:35:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro is a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.34,0:35:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.94,0:35:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.90,0:35:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon's still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugarra don't want to turn so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what made the clouds clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some crazy weather\Ntonight, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.10,0:36:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know the rage of the meek people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.52,0:36:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be? They took down Jack if\Nthey can stand up to a lead performer who
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.44,0:36:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,knows what else they're capable of no
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,matter after all it's\Nnone of my concern now
